							"description": "《车万女仆：心契同眠》是一个以车万女仆为核心的恋爱与家庭扩展模组。\n\n你可以与自己的女仆一步步培养好感、表白、交换戒指、缔结誓约，逐渐建立更亲密的关系。最终养育孩子，共同见证她的成长。模组加入了丰富的动作、亲密互动、心情变化、工作学习与探索等内容，让女仆不再只是旅途中的伙伴，而是能与你共同生活的家人。\n\nTouhou Little Maid: Heart Pact is a romance and family expansion built around Touhou Little Maid.\n\nBuild affection with your own maid step by step, confess your feelings, exchange rings, make vows, and grow into a closer relationship. Eventually, you can raise a child together and watch her grow. The mod adds rich animations, intimate interactions, mood changes, study tasks, work and exploration, turning your maid from a travel companion into family who shares life with you.",
